OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FFor Wales and southern England,
OL,6,Fpassing showers, possibly thundery in
OL,7,Fthe southwest. Persistent rain at
OL,8,Ftimes for southern Scotland and
OL,9,Fnorthern England. Brighter and showery
OL,10,Fin the north and west. Rather cold in
OL,11,Fthe north, but average in the south.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FMuch of the rain and showers
OL,14,Fmove off to the east, leaving clear
OL,15,Fspells, allowing temperatures to fall
OL,16,Fway, below freezing in the north with
OL,17,Fa widespread rural frost.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
