OL,5,CMonday:FA mostly dry and bright day on
OL,6,FMonday with sunny spells. Sunshine
OL,7,Fturns hazy into the afternoon with
OL,8,Frain moving into the southwest later.
OL,9,FFeeling chilly in the east.
